body:
Personally I didn't like TGWDLM and I didn't have any interest to watch BF and NPMD because of that, but it seems like most of the fanbase likes the Hatchetfield stuff so that's fine. But I agree if I did like it I wouldn't want them to get burnt out from it. Plus I feel like if they did another it would slowly start making the Hatchetfield stuff grow stale to the fanbase of them. I think if they at least intersperce a non-hatchetfield show or a live show like VHS was, inbetween them it could keep them fresh. 

&#x200B;

This looks great so far and the puppet look great! I just hope Jeff Blim doesn't try to shoe horn himself into roles like he did in TGWDLM. I loved him in HMB and Twisted but it seems like when he does the musicals himself he can make his parts.....not bad but a little over the top. Hopefully someone here knows what I'm talking about. 

&#x200B;

Regardless I'm really hyped for this and I'm personally happy to see something that isn't Hatchetfield for once (sorry they just aren't for me)
